flowchart TD
    A[D1NAMO Raw Data] --> B[Glucose CSV]
    A --> C[Food / Meal CSV]
    B --> D[Timestamp Parsing]
    C --> E[Meal Event Clustering]
    D --> F[Meal-Time Glucose Alignment]
    E --> F
    F --> G[0, 15, 40, 45, 60, 120 min readings]
    G --> H[Postprandial Features]
    H --> I[Peak / Excursion / AUC / Slopes / Recovery]

    F --> J[Common Features]
    J --> K[Subject-Aware Cross Validation]
    K --> L[Logistic Regression]
    K --> M[Random Forest]
    L --> N[Best D1NAMO Model]
    M --> N

    F --> O[2-hour Glucose]
    O --> P[D1NAMO Glucose-Only Model]
    P --> Q[PIMA Glucose]
    Q --> R[PIMA Outcome]
    P --> S[External Evaluation]

    T[Streamlit Input: Six Glucose Values] --> I
    T --> P
